    },
    {
      "id": "ripley004:30",
      "document_id": "ripley004",
      "document_sha256": "365c57d4b382e26a305d9342af67091c7e1ce3fc7b2c1da475013513e09f122f",
      "edition": "Ripley1591/TCP-aa59eb69/public-projection004",
      "start": 1286,
      "end": 1334,
      "text": "Looke how thou didst with thine vnperfect bodie,",
      "source_address": {
        "xml_path": "/TEI/text/body/div[3]/div[9]/lg[5]/l[2]",
        "section": "gate9",
        "stanza": 5,
        "line": 2,
        "upstream_sha256": "2f0265dc83f8d64a6fcd5fefd61bae4861cd2ac65c3bb0579f0b0837c457ba8b"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ripley004:31",
      "document_id": "ripley004",
      "document_sha256": "365c57d4b382e26a305d9342af67091c7e1ce3fc7b2c1da475013513e09f122f",
      "edition": "Ripley1591/TCP-aa59eb69/public-projection004",
      "start": 1335,
      "end": 1381,
      "text": "Doe so with thy perfect bodies in each degree,",
      "source_address": {
        "xml_path": "/TEI/text/body/div[3]/div[9]/lg[5]/l[3]",
        "section": "gate9",
        "stanza": 5,
        "line": 3,
        "upstream_sha256": "2f0265dc83f8d64a6fcd5fefd61bae4861cd2ac65c3bb0579f0b0837c457ba8b"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ripley004:32",
      "document_id": "ripley004",
      "document_sha256": "365c57d4b382e26a305d9342af67091c7e1ce3fc7b2c1da475013513e09f122f",
      "edition": "Ripley1591/TCP-aa59eb69/public-projection004",
      "start": 1382,
      "end": 1423,
      "text": "That is to say, first thou them putrifie,",
      "source_address": {
        "xml_path": "/TEI/text/body/div[3]/div[9]/lg[5]/l[4]",
        "section": "gate9",
        "stanza": 5,
        "line": 4,
        "upstream_sha256": "2f0265dc83f8d64a6fcd5fefd61bae4861cd2ac65c3bb0579f0b0837c457ba8b"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ripley004:33",
      "document_id": "ripley004",
      "document_sha256": "365c57d4b382e26a305d9342af67091c7e1ce3fc7b2c1da475013513e09f122f",
      "edition": "Ripley1591/TCP-aa59eb69/public-projection004",
      "start": 1424,
      "end": 1466,
      "text": "Their former qualities destroying vtterly,",
      "source_address": {
        "xml_path": "/TEI/text/body/div[3]/div[9]/lg[5]/l[5]",
        "section": "gate9",
        "stanza": 5,
        "line": 5,
        "upstream_sha256": "2f0265dc83f8d64a6fcd5fefd61bae4861cd2ac65c3bb0579f0b0837c457ba8b"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ripley004:34",
      "document_id": "ripley004",
      "document_sha256": "365c57d4b382e26a305d9342af67091c7e1ce3fc7b2c1da475013513e09f122f",
      "edition": "Ripley1591/TCP-aa59eb69/public-projection004",
      "start": 1467,
      "end": 1500,
      "text": "For this is wholly to our intent,",
      "source_address": {
        "xml_path": "/TEI/text/body/div[3]/div[9]/lg[5]/l[6]",
        "section": "gate9",
        "stanza": 5,
        "line": 6,
        "upstream_sha256": "2f0265dc83f8d64a6fcd5fefd61bae4861cd2ac65c3bb0579f0b0837c457ba8b"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ripley004:35",
      "document_id": "ripley004",
